WHY THE SPLIT

The code is an independent implementation written from the Bicubic++ paper
(Bilecen & Ayazoglu, CVPRW 2023). No source code and no weights from the upstream
Bicubic++ repository are included or derived from. Reading a paper and
implementing the published architecture does not create a derivative work, so the
upstream licence does not reach this code.

The weights are a different matter. They were trained from scratch on a dataset
whose sources include research-only material (see NOTICE). Whether trained
weights inherit restrictions from their training data is unsettled in most
jurisdictions, and the dataset terms themselves are about use, not about copies.
This file records the conservative reading rather than claiming the question is
resolved.

